# This repository

Overrides generic stack rules **for this project only**:

- **Vite** + **React 18** (not Next.js)
- **JavaScript** (`.jsx`) — no TypeScript yet
- **Tailwind CSS** via `src/index.css` — not SASS Modules
- Flat structure: `src/components/`, `src/hooks/`, `src/data/` (no `shared/` yet)
- Match existing patterns in sibling files when editing

When the user migrates to TS/SASS/Next, update or remove this rule.
